        <h2>VIDEO REQUIREMENTS</h2>
        <p>To qualify for the GIFT CARD, you must include the following 3 elements in your video:</p>
        <ul class="order-list">
          <li><span>1.</span> Mention our company name: <span>Tribe Organics</span></li>
          <li><span>2.</span> Clearly show <span>Your Face</span> and <span>Our Product(s)</span></li>
          <li><span>3.</span> Make sure you have <span>enough light</span> in the room!</li>
          <li><span>4.</span> Answer <span>both</span> of the following questions:</li>
        </ul>
        <ul class="unorder-list">
          <li><span><img loading="lazy"  src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0499/0425/5134/files/leave-pic.png?v=1682044463"></span> What is the reason you began taking our supplements?</li>
          <li><span><img loading="lazy"  src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0499/0425/5134/files/leave-pic.png?v=1682044463"></span> Why is it important to know what you put in your body?</li>
        </ul>
        <p><span>Don't want to take a video?</span> Send us a selfie picture with the product in hand instead following the above requirements and we will send you a <span>$10 Gift card to our store.</span></p>
